		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3286&amp;p=26297#p26297"><![CDATA[
4A for 25W output seems about right. <br><br>Of that about 1A is used by the radio and driver stages. So let's say 3A is being used by the PA. <br><br>3A * 13.8V = 41.4 W DC input. <br><br>That's about 60% efficiency which sounds reasonable. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sat Sep 16, 2023 12:09 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
